["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おまたせしました</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">感谢您的等待；抱歉让您久等了</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"126005\"><ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いことお<ruby>待<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たせしましたか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难道你等了很久吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おまちください</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\"><span lang=\"en\">Please wait a moment</span></span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146661\"><ruby>少々<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>おまちください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请稍等一下。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/423171\" title=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おまちどおさま</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">久等了；让您久等了</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お祭り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おまつり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">节日；庆典；狂欢节；祭典</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おまわりさん</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></