>(</rp><rt>ほっかいどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からのお<ruby>土産<rp>(</rp><rt>みやげ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是来自北海道的礼物。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おむつ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">尿布；尿片</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おめでたい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">值得庆贺的；值得祝贺的；幸运的；吉祥的；天真的；过于善良的；易受骗的；愚蠢的；单纯的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234603\">あいつは<ruby>本当<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>におめでたい<ruby>人間<rp>(</rp><rt>にんげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是一个真正的祝福的人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おめでとう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">恭喜；祝贺；恭喜恭喜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225482\">クリスマスおめでとうございます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">祝你圣诞节快乐。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/425680\" title=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お目に掛かる</span><span class=\