an class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おもいこむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">深信；确信；认为；以为；下定决心；铁了心；执意；一心想要；痴迷；执着于某种想法；反复思考</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"119479\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>僕<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にそう<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ませたのです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他让我这样想。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">思い出す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おもいだす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">想起；回忆；回想</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231433\">あなたを<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るとお<ruby>兄<rp>(</rp><rt>にい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんを<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>します。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看见你,我还记得哥哥。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">思いっきり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おもいっきり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">尽力；尽兴；竭力；用尽全力；全力以赴；尽其所能；坚决地；用力地；决心；果断；决断；认命</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">思い付き</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おもいつき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\